m that BlackRock discussing AI agents saving in $BTC no longer surprises anyone\n\n\"I spent much of the last month going to conferences, large wealth conferences, wirehouse conferences. And I will say the attitude has really shifted. Bitcoin has become really mainstream, right? You're no longer looked at in any way like the guy with horns on your head.\"\n\n\"You have Morgan Stanley launching ETFs, you have Wells Fargo putting Bitcoin into models. I suspect that that 2024 number will be eclipsed during this cycle pretty significantly in terms of inflows. I've never felt sort of the normalized feeling of Bitcoin as I have over the last month at these wealth platforms.\"\n\n\"It's really remarkable. BlackRock put out a note about AI agents using Bitcoin as a store of value, and no one blinked, right? I mean, that would have been like a fantasy dream. Think of that in 2022. Think of that in 2018. Completely absurd.\"\n\n\"You'd get excited if they muttered the word Bitcoin, even if it was followed by something like, is it worthless? Technological experiment? You'd be like, at least they said it. Now they're talking about AI agents saving in Bitcoin. It's really crazy.\""},"possibly_sensitive":false,"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":8997,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108543273220571172","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Matt Hougan says Bitcoin has become so mainstream that BlackRock discussing AI agents saving in $BTC no longer surprises anyone\n\n\"I spent much of the last month going to conferences, large wealth conferences, wirehouse conferences. And I will say the attitude has really shifted. https://t.co/G6UiVvB41n https://t.co/yDYkJsX2K4","url":"https://x.com/scottmelker/status/2108562282754269640"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108560502620028928"]},"author_id":"17525171","conversation_id":"2108561165999575502","created_at":"2026-10-09T14:12:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2